# Implement

Inspect relevant implementation, tests and conventions. Confirm the requested scope and any approved plan. Make focused changes, preserving unrelated work. Do not silently change public interfaces, data or dependencies. Add behavior-focused tests, run checks appropriate to risk, inspect the diff and report actual results and remaining limitations.

Examples: implement an approved endpoint; make a small requested validation change without creating a large design document. If a material design choice is missing, make progress on independent work and ask the user.
